---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout>
<section class="privacy-policy">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>This privacy policy applies to Gahema Press and the email list associated with the <strong>Canning Meat Cookbook for Beginners</strong> bonus content. If you have any questions, you can contact us at <strong>info@gahema-press.com</strong>.</p>

    <h2>2. What Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you subscribe to our list, we collect your name and email address. We do not collect any other personal data.</p>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <p>We use your data exclusively to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Send you the bonus content you requested via QR code</li>
      <li>Occasionally share canning tips, USDA-backed safety guidance, and related resources</li>
      <li>Inform you about new releases or products from Gahema Press that may be relevant to you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. How We Store Your Data</h2>
    <p>Your data is stored securely through our email marketing provider (Wildmail). We retain your data for as long as you remain subscribed to our list.</p>

    <h2>5. Third Parties</h2>
    <p>We will never sell, share, or rent your personal data to third parties. Your data is only shared with our email marketing provider for the purposes described above.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Unsubscribe at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link at the bottom of any email.</li>
      <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you.</li>
      <li>Request that we delete your personal data at any time.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <strong>info@gahema-press.com</strong>.</p>

    <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This page does not use cookies or any tracking technology.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy occasionally. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date at the top.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at [your email].</p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-policy {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: #1c1c1a;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .privacy-policy h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: #5f5e5a;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #1c1c1a;
  }

  .privacy-policy ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .privacy-policy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .privacy-policy p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>